{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0374_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ebefd54009ba4917892c2354132ab0e453618e21779827e6177797bef180d139", "ja": "（今日は新曲のPV撮影だ。\nそろそろエレナの準備はできてるかな……？）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄新曲的PV。\n艾莲娜差不多准备好了吗……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0374_1001_018ele", "source_sha256": "e61641e0c80f1ffebc15d1bd64abee3ff62c1fe063f8817d7cd0c2ab1cd016d6", "ja": "{$P$}！　ねえねえ、\n今日来てくれるダンサーさんってどこにいるノ？", "zh": "{$P$}！喂喂，今天要来的舞者在哪里呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0374_1002_p", "source_sha256": "1751e5d6ac8c7fe910d52548fe564dc2544e9b3e7a3bb5f84f32ab27fe16d67a", "ja": "ん？　ダンサーさんは別撮りだから、\n今日は誰も来てないけど……。", "zh": "嗯？舞者是另外拍摄的，所以今天没有人过来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0374_1003_018ele", "source_sha256": "2b403f7e01230e842c9ca3620cde9ace56ab72cc9b317da5a904ef591a3971a5", "ja": "ええ！？　そうだったノ？\nいっぱい人がいるのかと思ってたヨー。", "zh": "诶诶！？原来是这样的吗？我还以为会有很多人在呢——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0374_1004_p", "source_sha256": "8d42c3b85113e9d11270e76578d4c4902d93f8d92007853d0654871cf21c5077", "ja": "ごめん、うまく説明できてなかったみたいだな……。\n今日はエレナひとりなんだけど、大丈夫か？", "zh": "抱歉，看来我没能好好解释清楚……今天只有艾蕾娜一个人，没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0374_1005_018ele", "source_sha256": "7020eaad7a305ab9d3537e9887ba4c1cd2bf42839ee8f6843b81c0546fb5c2ac", "ja": "うん、大丈夫！　みんなで踊れるの楽しみに\nしてたから、ちょっと残念だけど……。", "zh": "嗯，没关系！因为本来很期待能和大家一起跳舞，虽然有点遗憾……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0374_1006_018ele", "source_sha256": "94dbad6ee1e24563967a5934a570f59fb5c9f870fdcc96965936f9662b79fa4d", "ja": "ステキな曲も、衣装も、セットもあるんだし。\nワタシひとりだって、バッチリ踊っちゃうヨ～！", "zh": "有这么棒的歌曲、服装和舞台布景。就算只有我一个人，也能跳得超棒哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0374_1007_p", "source_sha256": "066d2ec16d3bda87946a633a7ac37fb71d43e196bf9a6efd94499b81b6dad9f7", "ja": "ありがとう、頼もしいよ。でも確かに\nダンサーさんも一緒の方がよかったかもな。", "zh": "谢谢你，真靠得住啊。不过确实，\n有伴舞一起的话或许会更好呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0374_1008_018ele", "source_sha256": "41f6a268343f9d4f5f0a022738b6970cc43cf8781f035b2ec75a79306d33f696", "ja": "みんなと一緒に踊ったほうが、\n楽しさが何倍にもなるからネ。", "zh": "和大家一起跳的话，\n快乐就会翻好几倍呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0374_1009_p", "source_sha256": "66698e0bc1f5e30f38e53164c5001e892f530455671633ae3236f6afce9d373c", "ja": "そうだよな。でも、今から\nダンサーさんに来てもらうわけには……。", "zh": "是啊。不过，现在也不能让舞者过来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0374_1010_018ele", "source_sha256": "a6f50681874af2428df7154b6af74109b62ced6d184c9c6bcc4dddd379f50a53", "ja": "……あ！　じゃあ今日は、{$P$}が\nワタシと一緒に踊るっていうのはどう！？", "zh": "……啊！那今天由{$P$}\n来和我一起跳，你觉得怎么样！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0374_1011_018ele", "source_sha256": "506d3610cf812574ed2ed6bca070a17bf8d9e413bca67d6b3dad170196fb4230", "ja": "{$P$}がいてくれれば、\n最高のダンスができると思うナ♪", "zh": "只要有{$P$}在，我觉得就能跳出最棒的舞蹈♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0374_1012_p", "source_sha256": "ba53b9aa6c95c619d6594191fe9cb45a8ceb429ea32d0c6254d4c55ff838d101", "ja": "え？　い、いや、俺はダンスはうまくないし！\nさすがにダンサーさんの代わりというわけには……。", "zh": "诶？不、不是，我不太擅长跳舞啊！\n果然还是没法代替舞者……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0374_1013_018ele", "source_sha256": "2de20edeb664d44a3ee237c3f7d822f06ca192208f79ebb5c6482fb31a0a74e4", "ja": "近くで一緒に踊ってくれるだけでいいんだヨ～！\nダンスは楽しければオッケーなんだから♪", "zh": "只要在旁边陪我一起跳就好啦～！\n跳舞只要开心就OK♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0374_1014_p", "source_sha256": "447ce9d77558598ab4107cae16717daa204d6c736e29d83efee70bfc3cf00ee8", "ja": "そうか……よし、わかった。\nじゃあ今日は一緒に踊ろう、エレナ！", "zh": "这样啊……好，明白了。\n那今天就一起跳舞吧，艾蕾娜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0374_1015_018ele", "source_sha256": "39daf85b8c51b28dd5acb2fee2e4e90baed15525fb4fb955cb36fca9c6dbff73", "ja": "ヤッター！　{$P$}なら、\n1人でも100人分くらいの力があるヨ♪", "zh": "太棒了！只要有{$P$}在，就算只有1个人，也有大约100个人的力量哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0374_1016_018ele", "source_sha256": "d76e77c5f8890f2fa6760475776cc94ef8788184c4e0e7c1be262b6770832599", "ja": "ワタシも{$P$}に負けないように、\nいつもより激しく踊っちゃうゾ～！！", "zh": "我也不能输给{$P$}，要比平时跳得更卖力才行哦～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0374_1017_p", "source_sha256": "a5045505d86a7265e092888fc35eaa0155e32395483e24d18223ada167b72ce6", "ja": "ああ、俺もこうなったら全力で踊るぞ。\nふたりで最高のダンスをして、最高のPVにしよう！", "zh": "啊，既然这样，我也要全力起舞了。\n我们一起跳出最棒的舞蹈，把它拍成最棒的PV吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0374_1018_018ele", "source_sha256": "2862928acc0c53c8c19491909ea22ef28af7ca31c27d3535e3c2b78fa1b1c41f", "ja": "うん！　見てくれる人みーんなが笑顔になれるような\nとびっきりのPVにするヨ♪", "zh": "嗯！要让看到的人全都露出笑容，\n我们要拍出最棒的PV哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0374_1019_018ele", "source_sha256": "97a451c1a01eb0026bbc98885584fa45a19f829756582330154a4c61969ad29d", "ja": "エヘヘ、もう今すぐにでも踊りたくなっちゃった！\n{$P$}、早く行こっ♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，已经迫不及待想马上跳起来了！{$P$}，我们快走吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
